  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).<br />Assertion (A): Lithium salts are hydrated.<br />Reason (R) : Lithium has higher polarising power than other alkali metal group members.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>",
    "image": null
  },
